course: dictionary
lesson: 9374
title: Blends: two words become one
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A blend is a new word made from parts of two other words. Read the sentence: «A blend is a new word made from parts of two words, like spork, brunch and smog.» The clue is "parts of two words", so spork must come from two words squashed together.
explain: A spork is a spoon and a fork in one, so the two words are spoon and fork. The new word takes bits of each and joins them, so you get spork. Try it: say "spoon" and "fork" quickly, and you hear the new word.
explain: The same thing happens with «brunch», which comes from breakfast and lunch, and «smog», which comes from smoke and fog. Blends are a clever way that English makes new words, and when you spot one, you can work out its two parts.
fact: A spork is a plastic or metal eating tool that is a spoon and a fork in one.
fact: A blend is a new word made from parts of two words.
fact: Spork, brunch and smog are all blends.
fact: Sporks often come with take-away food, lunch boxes and camping kits.
fact: In the film Toy Story 4, the character Forky is made from a spork.
exercise: What is a spork? | A plate with a lid | *A spoon and a fork in one | A knife with a small saw edge
exercise: «A blend is a new word made from parts of two words, like spork, brunch and smog.» Which two words make brunch? | Spoon and fork | *Breakfast and lunch | Smoke and fog | Eat and drink
exercise: Which word is a blend? | Running | *Smog | Table | Happy
test: Which two words were squashed together to make smog? | *Smoke and fog | Spoon and fork | Breakfast and lunch | Small and dog
test: Why is spork called a blend? | It is a plastic plate with a lid | *It is made from parts of two words, spoon and fork | It is a name for a film | It is a word for camping
exam: Which word is a blend of breakfast and lunch? | *Brunch | Smog | Lunchbox | Table
